     "body": "<p>Draft updates to the main Digital Object Relationship pages are now at</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"http://fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/~penthes/Digital+Object+Relationships+-+draft+updates+for+RELS-INT\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/~penthes/Digital+Object+Relationships+-+draft+updates+for+RELS-INT</a></p>\n\n<p>I will also make minor amendments (with appropriate version health warnings) to </p>\n\n<p><a href=\"http://www.fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/Triples+in+the+Resource+Index\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/Triples+in+the+Resource+Index</a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/Resource+Index\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/Resource+Index</a><br/>\n<a href=\"http://www.fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/Fedora+Digital+Object+Model\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://www.fedora-commons.org/confluence/display/FCR30/Fedora+Digital+Object+Model</a></p>",
